From 55f3477ee5a52d124300a9e935d63fd79df0b781 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 11:24:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD visual yank selections for both terminal panes

Terminal command mode supports vim-style character, line, and block selections over the focused pane. The UI yanks the selected visible text into the terminal clipboard so users can copy either agent-list rows or the rendered chat scrollback without leaving Work Leaf.
